{"words": [{"text": "بَدِيعُ", "translation": "(The) Originator"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "translation": "(of) the heavens"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ", "translation": "and the earth"}, {"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قَضَىٰٓ", "translation": "He decrees"}, {"text": "أَمْرًۭا", "translation": "a matter"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "translation": "[so] only"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "He says"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to it"}, {"text": "كُن", "translation": "Be"}, {"text": "فَيَكُونُ", "translation": "and it becomes"}], "sahih": "Originator of the heavens and the earth. When He decrees a matter, He only says to it, \"Be,\" and it is."}